sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant O as Order Service
    participant B as RabbitMQ
    participant S as Saga Orchestrator
    participant I as Inventory Service
    participant P as Payment Service
    participant G as Gateway
    C->>O: POST /orders (Idempotency-Key)
    Note over O: Commit local Order(PENDING) + Outbox(OrderCreated)
    O-->>C: 202 Accepted (PENDING)
    O-->>B: OrderCreated (Outbox Relay)
    B-->>S: OrderCreated
    S-->>B: ReserveStock
    B-->>I: ReserveStock
    Note over I: Reserva atômica HELD com TTL
    I-->>B: StockReserved(reservationId, expiresAt)
    B-->>S: StockReserved
    S-->>B: ChargePayment(paymentOperationId)
    B-->>P: ChargePayment
    P->>G: HTTPS cobrança + chave idempotente
    G-->>P: CHARGED(transactionId)
    P-->>B: PaymentCharged
    B-->>S: PaymentCharged
    S-->>B: AllocateStock(reservationId)
    B-->>I: AllocateStock
    Note over I: Commit local HELD válido -> ALLOCATED sem TTL
    I-->>B: StockAllocated
    B-->>S: StockAllocated
    S-->>B: ConfirmOrder
    B-->>O: ConfirmOrder
    Note over O: Commit local CONFIRMED + Outbox
    O-->>B: OrderConfirmed
    B-->>S: OrderConfirmed (Saga COMPLETED)
    C->>O: GET /orders/{id}
    O-->>C: CONFIRMED
    Note over O,S: Alocação não permite expedir antes de OrderConfirmed
